  "title": "Swiss Cheese Soup",
  "description": "This garlicky veloute soup contains chicken broth and white wine thickened with a roux. A generous amount of grated Swiss cheese is melted into the flavorful broth immediately prior to serving.",
  "authors": [
    "Karena"
  ],
